WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:03.876
&gt;&gt; Laura: GOOD EVENING FROM

00:00:03.609 --> 00:00:05.378
WASHINGTON.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.979
I'M LAURA INGRAHAM.

00:00:05.511 --> 00:00:10.016
THIS IS "THE INGRAHAM ANGLE."

00:00:07.113 --> 00:00:11.350
WE HAVE BREAKING NEWS TONIGHT.

00:00:10.149 --> 00:00:13.853
"THE WASHINGTON POST" IS NOW

00:00:11.484 --> 00:00:17.123
REPORTING THAT FORMER FBI

00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:17.890
DIRECTOR ANDREW McCABE HAS BEEN

00:00:17.256 --> 00:00:21.093
FIRED.

00:00:18.024 --> 00:00:21.927
YES, THE EMBATTLED FORMER FBI

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:22.528
DIRECTOR, WE KNOW WHAT HAPPENED

00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:25.564
WITH HIM.

00:00:22.662 --> 00:00:27.967
WE KNOW THAT HIS WIFE OBVIOUSLY

00:00:25.698 --> 00:00:29.835
WAS RUNNING FOR STATE

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.071
REPRESENTATIVE, GOT HELP FROM

00:00:29.969 --> 00:00:33.973
TERRY McCULLOUGH.

00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:35.808
HIS PACT DONATED HUNDREDS OF

00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:38.644
THOUSANDS TO HER CAMPAIGN.

00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:41.747
IT WAS NOT REVEALED AT THE TIME,

00:00:38.778 --> 00:00:43.683
AND THAT RAISED A HUGE PROBLEM.

00:00:41.881 --> 00:00:44.016
HE'S BEEN EMBATTLED FOR SEVERAL

00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:45.685
MONTHS.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.720
A LOT OF US THOUGHT HE WOULD

00:00:45.818 --> 00:00:49.155
HAVE BEEN FIRED A LONG TIME AGO.

00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:50.256
HIS PENSION WOULD HAVE KICKED IN

00:00:49.288 --> 00:00:51.691
ON SUNDAY.

00:00:50.389 --> 00:00:54.593
YET IF HE'S FIRED TODAY, LOOKS

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:54.860
LIKE THAT PENSION WILL NOT KICK

00:00:54.727 --> 00:00:58.731
IN.

00:00:54.994 --> 00:01:00.533
SAN FRANCISCO ATTORNEY HARMEED

00:00:58.864 --> 00:01:01.934
DILLON, THE NATIONAL COMMIT

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:03.069
WOMAN FOR THE REASON NATIONAL

00:01:02.068 --> 00:01:04.637
COMMITTEE FOR CALIFORNIA.

00:01:03.202 --> 00:01:07.640
BREAKING NEWS TONIGHT.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:08.107
THIS REALLY SHOULD HAVE HAPPENED

00:01:07.773 --> 00:01:10.209
A LONG TIME AGO.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:12.411
I DON'T KNOW WHY THEY WAIT UNTIL

00:01:10.342 --> 00:01:15.414
TWO DAYS BEFORE HE WOULD RETIRE

00:01:12.545 --> 00:01:16.582
AND HIS PENSION WOULD KICK IN.

00:01:15.548 --> 00:01:16.916
NEVERTHELESS, THIS IS THE NEWS

00:01:16.716 --> 00:01:18.517
TONIGHT.

00:01:17.049 --> 00:01:20.186
YOUR REACTION.

00:01:18.651 --> 00:01:21.787
&gt;&gt; I AGREE WITH YOU.

00:01:20.319 --> 00:01:23.222
THIS SHOULD HAVE BEEN DONE

00:01:21.921 --> 00:01:24.557
AWHILE BACK.

00:01:23.355 --> 00:01:30.396
FBI DIRECTOR WRAY HAS TAKEN

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:33.032
STEPS TO REMOVE McCABE FROM ANY

00:01:30.529 --> 00:01:35.468
POSITIONS OF AUTHORITY.

00:01:33.165 --> 00:01:35.935
THE OFFICE OF PROFESSIONAL

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:36.902
RESPONSIBILITY.

00:01:36.068 --> 00:01:38.537
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL DIDN'T WANT

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:39.672
TO ACT UNTIL HE HAD THE

00:01:38.671 --> 00:01:41.607
RECOMMENDATION IN HAND AND MAKE

00:01:39.805 --> 00:01:44.744
THE DECISION HIMSELF.

00:01:41.741 --> 00:01:45.211
I'M GLAD THIS ACTION HAS BEEN

00:01:44.877 --> 00:01:47.012
TAKEN.

00:01:45.344 --> 00:01:50.216
CLEARLY MR. McCABE IS AT THE

00:01:47.146 --> 00:01:51.350
HEART OF A NUMBER OF

00:01:50.349 --> 00:01:51.817
CONTROVERSIES AND CONTINUING

00:01:51.484 --> 00:01:53.652
THROUGH TODAY.

00:01:51.951 --> 00:01:55.755
SO MAYBE THIS IS THE BEGINNING

00:01:53.786 --> 00:01:56.288
OF SOME RECKONING HAPPENING AT

00:01:55.888 --> 00:01:57.556
THE FBI.

00:01:56.422 --> 00:01:59.992
WITH THIS HEAD-ROLLING.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:01.393
THERE'S OTHERS, LISA PAGE, PETER

00:02:00.126 --> 00:02:04.096
STRZOK AND OTHERS --

00:02:01.527 --> 00:02:05.197
&gt;&gt; Laura: AND WE HAVE THE PETER

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:07.533
STRZOK NEWS THAT WE'RE ALSO

00:02:05.331 --> 00:02:08.534
GOING TO GET TO, HIS

00:02:07.666 --> 00:02:10.970
RELATIONSHIP WITH THE JUDGE WHO

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:13.672
HAS SINCE RECUSED HIMSELF.

00:02:11.103 --> 00:02:18.611
LET'S GO TO ALAN DERSHOWITZ.

00:02:13.806 --> 00:02:19.311
THIS JUST BROKE MINUTES AGO.

00:02:18.744 --> 00:02:20.045
McCABE IS OUT.

00:02:19.445 --> 00:02:23.682
YOUR REACTION.

00:02:20.179 --> 00:02:24.917
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO SEE THE EVIDENCE.

00:02:23.816 --> 00:02:28.053
IF THE EVIDENCE CONCLUDES THAT

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:29.822
HE WAS LESS THAN CANDIDATE AND

00:02:28.187 --> 00:02:30.956
MISLED INVESTIGATORS, THEN THE

00:02:29.955 --> 00:02:32.258
FIRING IS JUSTIFIED.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:33.492
YOU HAVE TO HAVE A HIGH

00:02:32.391 --> 00:02:35.294
THRESHOLD TO RETIRE SOMEONE ON

00:02:33.626 --> 00:02:37.863
THE EVE OF HIS RETIREMENT AND

00:02:35.427 --> 00:02:39.498
TAKE A WAY A PENSION HE'S EARNED

00:02:37.997 --> 00:02:39.832
OVER A LONG, LONG PERIOD OF

00:02:39.632 --> 00:02:40.733
TIME.

00:02:39.965 --> 00:02:41.600
&gt;&gt; Laura: 20 YEARS.

00:02:40.866 --> 00:02:41.901
&gt;&gt; GOOD SERVICE.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:44.436
YEAH.

00:02:42.034 --> 00:02:47.840
I WANT TO SEE THE EVIDENCE.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:48.140
IF THE EVIDENCE JUSTIFIES IT,

00:02:47.973 --> 00:02:49.408
FINE.

00:02:48.274 --> 00:02:51.343
AS FAR AS STRZOK IS CONCERNED,

00:02:49.542 --> 00:02:51.877
THAT'S AN OPEN AND SHOT CASE FOR

00:02:51.477 --> 00:02:52.978
FIRING.

00:02:52.011 --> 00:02:53.646
&gt;&gt; Laura: LET'S GO TO STRZOK IN

00:02:53.112 --> 00:02:55.414
A MINUTE.

00:02:53.779 --> 00:02:57.116
HOLD THAT SEPARATELY.

00:02:55.548 --> 00:03:00.419
A SEPARATE ISSUE INVOLVING THE

00:02:57.249 --> 00:03:02.354
JUDGE IN THE CASE, WHICH AGAIN,

00:03:00.553 --> 00:03:04.156
THIS COMES OUT TODAY AFTER

00:03:02.488 --> 00:03:05.124
INVESTIGATIVE REPORTER SARAH

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:07.893
CARTER BREAK THE STORY.

00:03:05.257 --> 00:03:11.163
WE KEEP SAYING EVERY DAY, IT

00:03:08.027 --> 00:03:11.463
CAN'T GET BUT KEEPS GETTING

00:03:11.297 --> 00:03:12.598
WORSE.

00:03:11.597 --> 00:03:14.800
JOINING US NOW, SARAH CARTER

00:03:12.731 --> 00:03:16.769
THAT BROKE THE STORY ABOUT PETER

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:19.071
STRZOK'S FRIENDSHIP IN THE CASE.

00:03:16.902 --> 00:03:19.471
SARAH, WE TALKED JUST A FEW

00:03:19.205 --> 00:03:22.374
MINUTES AGO.

00:03:19.605 --> 00:03:24.543
YOU SAID KEEP YOUR EYE OUT FOR

00:03:22.508 --> 00:03:24.977
THE McCABE FIRING.

00:03:24.677 --> 00:03:27.012
IT HAPPENED.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:28.380
TELL US WHAT LED TO THIS

00:03:27.146 --> 00:03:31.350
HAPPENING TWO DAYS BEFORE HE

00:03:28.514 --> 00:03:33.419
WOULD HAVE GOTTEN HIS PENSION.

00:03:31.483 --> 00:03:34.920
IT SEEMS ODD THAT IT WOULD BE

00:03:33.552 --> 00:03:36.755
HAPPENING THIS LATE.

00:03:35.054 --> 00:03:38.057
WHY DID IT TAKE THIS LONG FOR

00:03:36.889 --> 00:03:40.793
THE OFFICE OF PROFESSIONAL

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:41.160
RESPONSIBILITY TO COME TO THIS

00:03:40.926 --> 00:03:41.861
DECISION?

00:03:41.293 --> 00:03:43.529
&gt;&gt; THE OFFICE OF PROFESSIONAL

00:03:41.994 --> 00:03:45.898
RESPONSIBILITY, OPR, CAME TO THE

00:03:43.662 --> 00:03:48.534
DECISION THAT THEY WANTED HIM

00:03:46.031 --> 00:03:50.836
FIRED AFTER MICHAEL HOROWITZ

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:52.104
UNCOVERED A LOT OF INFORMATION

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:53.138
ON ANDREW McCABE --

00:03:52.238 --> 00:03:56.108
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE INSPECTOR GENERAL.

00:03:53.272 --> 00:03:57.743
&gt;&gt; YES, AT THE DOJ.

00:03:56.242 --> 00:04:03.616
THAT WAS REFERRED TO OPR.

00:03:57.877 --> 00:04:04.683
A LOT OF EXTENUATING

00:04:03.749 --> 00:04:06.418
CIRCUMSTANCES HERE.

00:04:04.817 --> 00:04:08.120
THERE'S MORE THAN JUST

00:04:06.552 --> 00:04:09.655
MISLEADING THE I.T. AND THE FBI

00:04:08.254 --> 00:04:10.556
AND LEAKS, WHICH IS WHAT HAVE

00:04:09.788 --> 00:04:12.091
BEEN REPORTED.

00:04:10.689 --> 00:04:13.559
WE ONLY KNOW A LITTLE BIT.

00:04:12.224 --> 00:04:15.761
&gt;&gt; Laura: GIVE US THE TWO OR

00:04:13.692 --> 00:04:17.096
THREE THINGS THAT ARE THE MOST

00:04:15.895 --> 00:04:18.998
EGREGIOUS THAT ARE OUT THERE

00:04:17.229 --> 00:04:20.232
THAT CALLED INTO QUESTION HIS

00:04:19.131 --> 00:04:20.499
PROFESSIONALISM IN HANDLING HIS

00:04:20.366 --> 00:04:23.869
JOB.

00:04:20.633 --> 00:04:25.471
&gt;&gt; CERTAINLY THE LEAKING TO THE

00:04:24.003 --> 00:04:28.173
MEDIA, NUMBER 1.

00:04:25.604 --> 00:04:29.808
ALSO THE FACT THAT HE LIED.

00:04:28.307 --> 00:04:32.177
HE BASICALLY LIED TO THE FBI, TO

00:04:29.942 --> 00:04:32.544
HIS OWN EMPLOYERS AND TO THE

00:04:32.311 --> 00:04:34.113
I.G.

00:04:32.678 --> 00:04:35.047
AND I THINK --

00:04:34.246 --> 00:04:36.916
&gt;&gt; Laura: ABOUT?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:38.250
&gt;&gt; ABOUT HIS RELATIONSHIP

00:04:37.049 --> 00:04:40.219
ACTUALLY AND HIS FRIENDSHIPS

00:04:38.384 --> 00:04:41.687
WITH STRZOK, ABOUT WHAT WAS

00:04:40.352 --> 00:04:44.189
HAPPENING WITH THE HILLARY

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:46.058
CLINTON E-MAIL INVESTIGATION AND

00:04:44.323 --> 00:04:46.992
REMEMBER, HE GAVE THAT

00:04:46.191 --> 00:04:48.427
INFORMATION TO THE "WALL STREET

00:04:47.126 --> 00:04:49.995
JOURNAL."

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.397
APPARENTLY HE AUTHORIZED THAT.

00:04:50.129 --> 00:04:53.532
WHEN THEY BROKE THAT STORY AND

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:55.100
HE WENT BACK AND THE I.G. SAID

00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:56.035
HEY, WERE YOU RESPONSIBLE FOR

00:04:55.234 --> 00:04:56.835
AUTHORIZING THESE LEAKS?

00:04:56.168 --> 00:04:58.237
HE SAID NO.

00:04:56.969 --> 00:04:59.838
THAT'S ACCORDING TO SOURCES THAT

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.273
I'VE SPOKEN WITH.

00:04:59.972 --> 00:05:01.640
I THINK THIS GOES FAR BEYOND

00:05:01.407 --> 00:05:03.943
THAT.

00:05:01.774 --> 00:05:04.710
THEY'RE ALSO LOOKING AT POSSIBLE

00:05:04.076 --> 00:05:05.210
CRIMINAL CHARGES.

00:05:04.843 --> 00:05:08.247
&gt;&gt; Laura: WOW!

00:05:05.344 --> 00:05:11.717
&gt;&gt; THAT COULD BE SERIOUS.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:12.918
&gt;&gt; ALAN DERSHOWITZ.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.620
&gt;&gt; Laura: CRIMINAL CHARGES.

00:05:13.052 --> 00:05:15.421
THIS IS THE SECOND TIME I'VE

00:05:14.753 --> 00:05:17.756
HEARD THIS TODAY.

00:05:15.554 --> 00:05:20.359
THE EARLIER TIME WAS 2:00 P.M.

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:21.360
FROM ONE OF MY SOURCES IN THE

00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:23.128
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT TODAY THAT

00:05:21.493 --> 00:05:25.397
SAID YOU ALL KNOW JUST A LITTLE

00:05:23.262 --> 00:05:27.266
BIT OF WHAT HAS GONE ON WITH

00:05:25.531 --> 00:05:29.435
ANDREW McCABE.

00:05:27.399 --> 00:05:29.835
20-YEAR VETERAN OF THE

00:05:29.568 --> 00:05:32.037
DEPARTMENT.

00:05:29.969 --> 00:05:33.005
VERY WELL-RESPECTED FOR YEARS.

00:05:32.171 --> 00:05:36.041
APPARENTLY WE DON'T KNOW WHAT

00:05:33.138 --> 00:05:37.977
THE OPR KNOWS AND WHAT THE

00:05:36.175 --> 00:05:38.577
INSPECTOR GENERAL KNOWS.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.379
WE'LL FIND OUT.

00:05:38.711 --> 00:05:41.780
&gt;&gt; I'D HAVE TO AGREE WITH SARAH.

00:05:40.512 --> 00:05:43.882
IT'S HARD TO BELIEVE THAT HE

00:05:41.914 --> 00:05:47.286
WOULD GET FIRED FOR THE LEAKING,

00:05:44.016 --> 00:05:49.054
ALTHOUGH THAT IS VERY EGREGIOUS.

00:05:47.419 --> 00:05:51.857
THE WALL STREET STORY THAT CAME

00:05:49.188 --> 00:05:53.759
OUT, THE PRODUCT OF THE LEAKS,

00:05:51.991 --> 00:05:55.461
WAS CLEARLY TO HAVE PAVED HIS

00:05:53.892 --> 00:05:56.895
ROLE IN A DIFFERENT LIGHT AND A

00:05:55.594 --> 00:05:57.963
LOT OF OTHER POLITICKING GOING

00:05:57.029 --> 00:06:00.532
ON IN THAT STORY.

00:05:58.097 --> 00:06:02.901
THAT WAS SHOCKING.

00:06:00.666 --> 00:06:03.802
THIS SEEMS LIKE TURN AROUND IS

00:06:03.035 --> 00:06:05.738
FAR PLAY.

00:06:03.936 --> 00:06:07.740
WE'VE SEEN STORIES ABOUT HOW

00:06:05.871 --> 00:06:09.742
GENERAL FLYNN HAS BEEN INDICTED

00:06:07.873 --> 00:06:11.443
AND ASKED TO PLEAD GUILTY ON

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:14.980
CHARGES OF A LIE TO THE FBI.

00:06:11.577 --> 00:06:16.115
YOU HAVE THE FBI, NUMBER 3 IN

00:06:15.114 --> 00:06:17.950
COMMAND, TEMPORARILY NUMBER 1 IN

00:06:16.248 --> 00:06:19.151
COMMAND LYING HIMSELF TO OTHER

00:06:18.083 --> 00:06:21.020
FBI AGENTS.

00:06:19.284 --> 00:06:23.922
SEEMS APPROPRIATELY TO HOLD THEM

00:06:21.153 --> 00:06:25.457
TO THE SAME STANDARDS.

00:06:24.056 --> 00:06:27.393
&gt;&gt; PROFESSOR DERSHOWITZ, A

00:06:25.591 --> 00:06:28.861
FRIDAY NIGHT, TWO DAYS BEFORE A

00:06:27.526 --> 00:06:30.496
MAN WHO HAS SERVED THE

00:06:28.994 --> 00:06:32.197
GOVERNMENT FOR DECADES AND WAS

00:06:30.629 --> 00:06:33.932
VERY WELL-RESPECTED BEFORE THE

00:06:32.331 --> 00:06:36.502
HILLARY CLINTON E-MAIL

00:06:34.066 --> 00:06:39.271
INVESTIGATION I THINK TOOK PLACE

00:06:36.635 --> 00:06:42.174
TO BE FIRED IN THIS WAY, I HAVE

00:06:39.405 --> 00:06:43.709
TO -- I HAVE TO TAKE SARAH AND

00:06:42.307 --> 00:06:45.577
HER REPORTING TO HEART HERE.

00:06:43.842 --> 00:06:48.280
I DON'T THINK THEY WOULD RISK

00:06:45.711 --> 00:06:49.415
FIRING HIM WERE IT NOT FOR SOME

00:06:48.414 --> 00:06:52.017
FAIRLY SERIOUS INFORMATION THAT

00:06:49.548 --> 00:06:56.755
HAS COME TO LIGHT AND WILL BE

00:06:52.151 --> 00:06:58.157
REPORTED BY THE I.G.

00:06:56.889 --> 00:07:01.160
&gt;&gt; THIS SOUNDS RIGHT TO ME.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:02.694
THIS AFTERNOON I SAID THERE HAS

00:07:01.293 --> 00:07:03.996
TO BE A HIGH BURN BEFORE YOU

00:07:02.828 --> 00:07:06.231
FIRE SOMEBODY WHO HAS PERFORMED

00:07:04.129 --> 00:07:06.532
IN A DISTINGUISHED WAY FOR 20

00:07:06.365 --> 00:07:08.000
YEARS.

00:07:06.665 --> 00:07:10.436
I HAVE A LOT OF EXPERIENCE WITH

00:07:08.133 --> 00:07:11.303
THE OPR, THE OFFICE OF

00:07:10.569 --> 00:07:13.639
PROFESSIONAL RESPONSIBILITY.

00:07:11.437 --> 00:07:15.140
THEY DON'T GENERALLY GO AFTER

00:07:13.772 --> 00:07:17.509
THEIR OWN.

00:07:15.274 --> 00:07:17.776
THEY GENERALLY WHITE WASH THEIR

00:07:17.643 --> 00:07:20.579
OWN.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:22.681
WHEN THE OPR COMES TO THIS

00:07:20.712 --> 00:07:23.949
CONCLUSION, YOU REALLY HAVE TO

00:07:22.815 --> 00:07:26.618
GIVE IT SOME CREDIBILITY.

00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:26.985
I STILL WANT TO SEE THE

00:07:26.752 --> 00:07:28.754
EVIDENCE.

00:07:27.119 --> 00:07:31.123
I BET YOU WE'LL SEE EVIDENCE

00:07:28.887 --> 00:07:32.991
THAT IS FAR MORE COMPELLING THAN

00:07:31.256 --> 00:07:33.258
WHAT WE'VE HEARD ABOUT UP TILL

00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:34.860
NOW.

00:07:33.392 --> 00:07:36.095
WHEN WE HEARD ABOUT CRIMINAL

00:07:34.993 --> 00:07:36.428
CHARGES, THAT SOUNDS VERY

00:07:36.228 --> 00:07:37.396
SERIOUS.

00:07:36.562 --> 00:07:39.398
IT'S DISTRESSING.

00:07:37.529 --> 00:07:41.033
I HAD A LOT OF RESPECT FOR

00:07:39.531 --> 00:07:42.501
McCABE BASED ON WHAT PEOPLE THAT

00:07:41.166 --> 00:07:43.335
WORKED IN THE FBI HAVE TOLD ME

00:07:42.634 --> 00:07:45.003
OVER THE YEARS.

00:07:43.469 --> 00:07:45.404
BUT YOU CAN'T HAVE A DOUBLE

00:07:45.137 --> 00:07:47.039
STANDARD.

00:07:45.537 --> 00:07:48.140
YOU HAVE TO HAVE THE SAME

00:07:47.172 --> 00:07:49.208
STANDARD FOR DEMOCRAT, FOR

00:07:48.273 --> 00:07:51.844
REPUBLICAN, FOR PEOPLE THAT HAVE

00:07:49.341 --> 00:07:53.479
BEEN IN THE FBI AND FOR

00:07:51.977 --> 00:07:57.883
CIVILIANS.

00:07:53.612 --> 00:08:00.819
IF THAT STANDARD HAS BEEN MET

00:07:58.016 --> 00:08:02.221
FOR CRIMINAL PROSECUTION AND

00:08:00.953 --> 00:08:03.689
FIRE IT, SO BE IT.

00:08:02.354 --> 00:08:07.993
&gt;&gt; THE ATTORNEY GENERAL SAYS THE

00:08:03.822 --> 00:08:12.598
FBI EXPECTS EVERY EMPLOYEE TO

00:08:08.127 --> 00:08:19.471
ADHERE TO THE HIGHEST STANDARDS

00:08:12.731 --> 00:08:15.517
OF ENTECH

00:08:15.517 --> 00:08:15.767
OF ENTEC

00:08:15.767 --> 00:08:15.801
OF EN TC

00:08:15.801 --> 00:08:15.834
OF EN TEC

00:08:15.834 --> 00:08:15.951
OF EN TECH

